# Generated artifacts — must never ride the build context.
# Measured 2026-08-27: two stale tarballs (awkit-0.1.0.tgz,
# restamped-aitheros-portal-kit-0.1.0.tgz) in this tree made the gargbot
# Dockerfile's `mv awkit-*.tgz` match TWO files and fail the build. Pack
# fresh inside the image; a stale copy in the context is a lie waiting to
# ship. node_modules is excluded too (installed fresh per image).
node_modules
*.tgz
